    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37075" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔξειμι</span></b>  (B), (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰμί</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sum</i>), only used in impers.
			forms (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔξεστι</span>), exc. in
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰ ἐλεύθεροι μὴ ἐξεῖεν</span> if
			[a woman] shall leave no free-born <i>issue,</i>
